  Don't take the damage in the first place.  In NetHack it's much
easier to stay out of trouble than to get out of trouble.

  Tactics for avoiding damage:

  - Elbereth early and often.
  - Hide behind your pets.
    - Tame an extra pet.
    - Develop your pets.
      - Two large dog/cats can handle almost anything in the Mines.
  - Bravely run away.
  - Don't be burdened.  
    - The only speed worse than slow is dead slow.
    - Make stashes of non-essentials.
  - Try on every non-cursed piece of armor you find.
    - Your pet can help here.
    - Once your AC is below zero you start taking less damage per hit.
  - Don't fight at melee range if you can help it.
    - If the monster is in melee range, so are you.
    - Melee range fighting is the best way to die in NetHack.


